{"id":"730162c45cd0b387","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-basic-functions.md","title":"Basic Functions","display":"df-basic-functions — Basic Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-basic-functions","aliases":["68-df-basic-functions"],"display":"df-basic-functions — Basic Functions","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§5 initial functions and Proposition 5.1, p.8 / PDF 17","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-basic-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-basic-functions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basic-functions — Basic Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5 initial functions and Proposition 5.1, p.8 / PDF 17"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与有限元组见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\">\\(c_0\\)</span> 为零元函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,S\">\\(Z,S\\)</span> 为一元函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span> 为 n 元函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_0:=\\{((),0)\\},\\quad Z:=\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad S:=\\{(x,x+1):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\pi_i^n:=\\{(\\vec x,x_i):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_0:=\\{((),0)\\},\\quad Z:=\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad S:=\\{(x,x+1):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\pi_i^n:=\\{(\\vec x,x_i):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BasicFunc}:=\\{c_0,Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land0\\le i&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BasicFunc}:=\\{c_0,Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land0\\le i&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §5，印刷 p.8 / PDF p.17。原书初始函数含零元常数 0、后继、投影；本目录兼容保留一元零函数 Z。补入 c_0 是实质修复：先前只有一元 Z，且复合不允许零元输入，不能生成本书允许的零元函数。Z 可由 c_0 的零元复合得到，因此冗余初始函数不改变生成类。所有图均显式给出，元数不依赖 Remark。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 与有限元组见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$n,i\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$i<n$，$\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\in\\mathbb N^n$。$c_0$ 为零元函数，$Z,S$ 为一元函数，$\\pi_i^n$ 为 n 元函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n,i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"i<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1})\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"c_0","display":false},{"tex":"Z,S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^n","display":false},{"tex":"c_0:=\\{((),0)\\},\\quad Z:=\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad S:=\\{(x,x+1):x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\pi_i^n:=\\{(\\vec x,x_i):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BasicFunc}:=\\{c_0,Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n:n\\ge1\\land0\\le i<n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1483,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-functions]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-functions]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-functions|df-basic-functions — Basic Functions]]"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2"]}